<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopia has intensified its regional role by offering to host a comprehensive Sudanese dialogue and Abiy Ahmed is urging Sudanese parties to join a mediation table, while drone strikes linked to Ethiopia killed four people and damaged a United Nations building in Khartoum. At the same time, artillery shelling by Ethiopian forces in Alamata killed 14 civilians, prompting Amnesty International to call for a war crimes investigation in Tigray. Leaked intelligence suggests coordination between Eritrean and Sudanese actors in drone strikes on Mekelle and Assosa. Ethiopian forces have regained control of border areas near Badme, and clashes continue along the Afar-Somali border over territory, drought and resources. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPaVBhcThUYl9UZXJzYTB5RFdDREtzVGs2VUJ5OG9DRjNOTGJMbUFXdzdYT0tBT1JncFVwQ25sNzlvZTR3ck93UW5rMWswRHNBbUNsczN0aS14SUtXQi1uT1ctZE1BTVYwY2xWLWZSTGN4NFBHRXJTS3hWUEhvUWR3cDg2V1FnQXFmX1I1Nkc3TW5uWHN1WGtQTDBTbzhEbjRDZFAwNjMxWDdTaG93ZjIxUmFEUDdoMFZlVHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPcjdCT1JfMUktb3hHTkJUbk1PWkplV3FNZEs3Z3hNazNEYXFHcXB4QWRaRm9kSUdIbjcxNHZUbDBobldsSzByWGVzU0NlUVRPOGdIcUtMNnA0VHVES1dRYVVMZkVGSk5NZFFVM2p4cXVTSWIyWnJNeFNuUzVlNHQyTEdCZlBoX0N1MlRWdUliaGU0dGYySVhnODU0MA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latest news from Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQaXEwVVdYLWZNcHRVazd4LTd1SEdndUpJQUxaV08wSDc2NHlpM1VCMU9wVmNNYVJpd2tUWG5RaEYxSW9EWEhidC1jTGM3UnFEaXBhU1BoV2QzeEVDNFktUlllczU4QTY5cmZfSVNuSm5YZzV1Um1ULVFDV25QUElyR0F0ekhiSkxBc19RUzd3SHloMWg1MktYZFdJazA1enBNcG9BRkNwcXo?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomsb